# CodeAlpha - Student Grade Tracker

## 📌 Project Description

Student Grade Tracker is a Java console-based application developed using Object-Oriented Programming (OOP).
The program allows users to enter and manage student grades, calculate average marks, identify highest and lowest scores, and display a complete summary report.

---

## 🚀 Features

* Add student names and grades
* Store data using ArrayList
* Calculate:

  * Average score
  * Highest score
  * Lowest score
* Display all student records
* Simple console-based interface
* Implemented using Java OOP concepts

---

